    "detailed_description": "Welcome to <strong>Easy Bubbles</strong>, the <strong>ultimate idle aquarium sanctuary </strong>where <strong>tranquil gameplay </strong>meets <strong>deep strategic choices</strong>. Immerse yourself in a <strong>richly detailed underwater realm</strong>, meticulously hand-drawn in crisp 2D cartoon style, and discover why Easy Bubbles is more than just an idle game\u2014it\u2019s your <strong>personal aquatic retreat</strong>.<br><br><strong>Discover New Species</strong><br>In <strong>Easy Bubbles</strong>, every fish packet you open adds something unexpected to your aquarium. There are <strong>seven themed fish packs</strong>, <strong>each offering any of the 58 species </strong>available in the game. You never know whether you\u2019ll unbox a tiny fry or a full-grown beauty\u2014each species appears in <strong>two life stages</strong>, <strong>baby </strong>and <strong>adult</strong>, and in four distinct visual variants: <strong>Normal</strong>, <strong>Colorful</strong>, <strong>Golden </strong>and <strong>Rainbow</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/a9e80b7a238215c724fc961661ddf1c9.poster.avif?t=1750284408\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/a9e80b7a238215c724fc961661ddf1c9.webm?t=1750284408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/a9e80b7a238215c724fc961661ddf1c9.mp4?t=1750284408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>To make things even more exciting, every fish is assigned one of seven rarity levels:<br><strong>Common,Uncommon,Rare,Epic,Legendary,Mythic,Ancient</strong><br><br><strong>Expansive Fish Library</strong><br>58 species to discover<br>2 life stages per species (baby and adult)<br>4 visual variants per stage (Normal, Colorful, Golden, Rainbow)<br><br><strong>That\u2019s over 406 base designs and more than 3,200 total illustrations to collect and admire.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/111762374499470d1bc1d7f57ba97ec5.poster.avif?t=1750284408\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/111762374499470d1bc1d7f57ba97ec5.webm?t=1750284408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/111762374499470d1bc1d7f57ba97ec5.mp4?t=1750284408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Real-Time Growth &amp; Strategic Choices</strong><br>Watch your fish grow from fry into mature adults in real time. You can Manually care for feeding and tank upkeep to speed up growth, or Enable Auto-AFK so your aquarium prospers even when you\u2019re away.<br><br>Decide whether to <strong>sell fully grown fish for an instant reward </strong>or <strong>keep them to earn steady passive income</strong>. Your timing and choices shape how quickly your <strong>underwater empire expands</strong>.<br><br><strong>Play in the Background While You Work</strong><br>Keep Easy Bubbles running quietly beside your other tasks. Activate background mode to let your fish continue growing and earning even as you focus on work, study or browsing. With soothing visuals and gentle ambient sounds, your aquarium becomes the perfect desktop companion.<br><br><strong>Exclusive Booster Packs</strong><br>For collectors seeking the rarest specimens, booster packs give you a shortcut to special variants and ultra-rare colorations. Each pack opening is a mini-event\u2014will you land a Common fry or unbox an Ancient Rainbow adult?<br><br><strong>Customizable Aquarium Environments<br>Shape your perfect tank environment with:</strong><br>-<strong>Multiple tank </strong>designs and scenic backgrounds<br>-Adjustable day-night <strong>lighting </strong>cycles<br>-<strong>Decorative elements </strong>such as coral arches, seaweed beds and shipwreck remnants<br><br>Relaxing ambient soundtracks or oceanic nature sounds<br><br><strong>Personalized Naming &amp; Community Sharing</strong><br>Assign each fish a name that fits its personality and Share them directly from the game to our community galleries. Exchange tips, admire each other\u2019s tanks and celebrate your unique collections.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/d5a7a0adc3065ae59736e028f6cc6275.poster.avif?t=1750284408\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/d5a7a0adc3065ae59736e028f6cc6275.webm?t=1750284408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/d5a7a0adc3065ae59736e028f6cc6275.mp4?t=1750284408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Easy Bubbles combines soothing, hands-off gameplay with deep collection mechanics. Whether you\u2019re unwinding after a long day or setting goals to complete your fish library, you\u2019ll find endless delight swimming just beneath the surface. Dive in and start building your dream aquarium today!",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to <strong>Easy Bubbles</strong>, the <strong>ultimate idle aquarium sanctuary </strong>where <strong>tranquil gameplay </strong>meets <strong>deep strategic choices</strong>. Immerse yourself in a <strong>richly detailed underwater realm</strong>, meticulously hand-drawn in crisp 2D cartoon style, and discover why Easy Bubbles is more than just an idle game\u2014it\u2019s your <strong>personal aquatic retreat</strong>.<br><br><strong>Discover New Species</strong><br>In <strong>Easy Bubbles</strong>, every fish packet you open adds something unexpected to your aquarium. There are <strong>seven themed fish packs</strong>, <strong>each offering any of the 58 species </strong>available in the game. You never know whether you\u2019ll unbox a tiny fry or a full-grown beauty\u2014each species appears in <strong>two life stages</strong>, <strong>baby </strong>and <strong>adult</strong>, and in four distinct visual variants: <strong>Normal</strong>, <strong>Colorful</strong>, <strong>Golden </strong>and <strong>Rainbow</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/a9e80b7a238215c724fc961661ddf1c9.poster.avif?t=1750284408\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/a9e80b7a238215c724fc961661ddf1c9.webm?t=1750284408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/a9e80b7a238215c724fc961661ddf1c9.mp4?t=1750284408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>To make things even more exciting, every fish is assigned one of seven rarity levels:<br><strong>Common,Uncommon,Rare,Epic,Legendary,Mythic,Ancient</strong><br><br><strong>Expansive Fish Library</strong><br>58 species to discover<br>2 life stages per species (baby and adult)<br>4 visual variants per stage (Normal, Colorful, Golden, Rainbow)<br><br><strong>That\u2019s over 406 base designs and more than 3,200 total illustrations to collect and admire.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/111762374499470d1bc1d7f57ba97ec5.poster.avif?t=1750284408\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/111762374499470d1bc1d7f57ba97ec5.webm?t=1750284408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/111762374499470d1bc1d7f57ba97ec5.mp4?t=1750284408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Real-Time Growth &amp; Strategic Choices</strong><br>Watch your fish grow from fry into mature adults in real time. You can Manually care for feeding and tank upkeep to speed up growth, or Enable Auto-AFK so your aquarium prospers even when you\u2019re away.<br><br>Decide whether to <strong>sell fully grown fish for an instant reward </strong>or <strong>keep them to earn steady passive income</strong>. Your timing and choices shape how quickly your <strong>underwater empire expands</strong>.<br><br><strong>Play in the Background While You Work</strong><br>Keep Easy Bubbles running quietly beside your other tasks. Activate background mode to let your fish continue growing and earning even as you focus on work, study or browsing. With soothing visuals and gentle ambient sounds, your aquarium becomes the perfect desktop companion.<br><br><strong>Exclusive Booster Packs</strong><br>For collectors seeking the rarest specimens, booster packs give you a shortcut to special variants and ultra-rare colorations. Each pack opening is a mini-event\u2014will you land a Common fry or unbox an Ancient Rainbow adult?<br><br><strong>Customizable Aquarium Environments<br>Shape your perfect tank environment with:</strong><br>-<strong>Multiple tank </strong>designs and scenic backgrounds<br>-Adjustable day-night <strong>lighting </strong>cycles<br>-<strong>Decorative elements </strong>such as coral arches, seaweed beds and shipwreck remnants<br><br>Relaxing ambient soundtracks or oceanic nature sounds<br><br><strong>Personalized Naming &amp; Community Sharing</strong><br>Assign each fish a name that fits its personality and Share them directly from the game to our community galleries. Exchange tips, admire each other\u2019s tanks and celebrate your unique collections.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/d5a7a0adc3065ae59736e028f6cc6275.poster.avif?t=1750284408\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/d5a7a0adc3065ae59736e028f6cc6275.webm?t=1750284408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651560/extras/d5a7a0adc3065ae59736e028f6cc6275.mp4?t=1750284408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Easy Bubbles combines soothing, hands-off gameplay with deep collection mechanics. Whether you\u2019re unwinding after a long day or setting goals to complete your fish library, you\u2019ll find endless delight swimming just beneath the surface. Dive in and start building your dream aquarium today!",
